{"4626060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmic Carl", "steam_appid": 4626060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4785440], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Carl is a difficult, fast paced, physics based game where you hurtle through space as Carl the Alien. Race against the clock through levels full of whacky physics interactions and perilous obstacles, space worms. And space missiles. And space spikes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626060/extras/50d29a046b3eb62e46fa99149adf7455.poster.avif?t=1781149971\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626060/extras/50d29a046b3eb62e46fa99149adf7455.webm?t=1781149971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626060/extras/50d29a046b3eb62e46fa99149adf7455.mp4?t=1781149971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carl's spherical force field is great for bouncing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626060/extras/aa2589f2e004e95e21943982cce6b074.poster.avif?t=1781149971\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626060/extras/aa2589f2e004e95e21943982cce6b074.webm?t=1781149971\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4626060/extras/aa2589f2e004e95e21943982cce6b074.mp4?t=1781149971\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience gravity! Wow!</